## 6. Database schema (packages)

There is **no** `student_class_packages` table. Linking is:

- **`StudentClass`**: `PackageID`, `PackageTotalSessions`, `PackageName` — `/home/admin/backend/database/migrations/2026_04_15_300000_add_package_fields_to_student_class.php`
- **`course_packages`**: created in `/home/admin/backend/database/migrations/2026_04_15_300001_create_package_session_ledger.php` with `student_id`, `campus_id`, `name`, `total_sessions`, `remaining_sessions`, `used_sessions`, `rate`, `rate_unit`, `class_type`, `paid`, `paid_at`, `stop`, `closed_reason`, `enabled`, timestamps
- **`package_session_ledger`**: same migration — `package_id`, `student_class_id`, `class_session_id`, `delta`, `reason`, etc., with unique `(package_id, class_session_id, reason)`

Later **`billing_mode`**, **`monthly_fee`**, **`settlement_day`** were added in `/home/admin/backend/database/migrations/2026_04_17_300000_add_billing_mode_to_course_packages.php`; **`monthly_fee`** is dropped in `/home/admin/backend/database/migrations/2026_04_17_400000_drop_monthly_fee_from_course_packages.php`.

